# Agent instructions and planning docs — kept on disk, never pushed. They say how
# to work on this repository rather than what it does, which is no use to anyone
# reading it on GitHub. Matches cygnus / cygnus-api / vertex-web, where docs/ was
# untracked on 19/08/2026.
#
# Consequence, and it is the reason this is worth stating here: a code comment or
# README that says "see CLAUDE.md" or "see docs/x.md" is a dead pointer for
# everyone outside this working copy. Comments must carry their own reasoning.
